      "id": "claim_83af2386248242d68bc24b8a05544028",
      "statement": "The browser face mounts into the harness shell purely through ctx.slots.inject into named slot maps, where the slot name and the register({ name, id, order|priority }) identity decide visibility and ordering; there is no imperative React mounting. The dashboard (order 20), skill-forge (30), tool-integrations (40), and a2a-management (50) tabs fill conversation.view; the pet and task-manager-panel (order 100) fill shell.overlay; the Papergames logo/wordmark shadow the brand slots at priority -1; the background switcher (order 10) and task-manager trigger (order 20) fill sidebar.footer.action and conversation.session.header.actions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/client/index.ts#L120-L157",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:254bce2671a4bbf7515db0c03cb1a26a0e8c5cb2913ea24169282cfbeb331f8f:"
