      "statement": "The task-manager-panel slot (TaskManagerView) is registered inside the pet-panel-capabilities child plugin, not the main apply() function, because its inject closure reads remote.skillForge which only resolves after Typert $mount and only inside a child context whose inject array lists remote.skillForge; the main apply() context holds remote but not remote.skillForge and accessing it throws 'without inject'.",
