      "statement": "The Papergames brand swap uses priority -1 to shadow the host's whale mark: sidebar.brand.mark, sidebar.brand.name, and conversation.hero.brand.mark are single slots with default priority 0 filled by dsh-client-ui-brand-official, and the lowest-priority occupant renders. applyPapergamesFavicon repoints link[rel=icon].href to an inline SVG data URI; applyHeroCopyRewrite uses a MutationObserver to rewrite the DeepSeek slogan and hide the preview badge at the DOM level (rather than re-registering the locale, which would throw 'already has locale'), returning a dispose function.",
