      "statement": "DashboardView derives every metric from standard framework feeds (useSessions byId summaries, useWorkspaces archived ids, and dsh-token-meter projection values) via pure helpers wrapped in useMemo: weeklyActivity (trailing 7-day buckets), sessionStats (total/running/today), tokenOverview (cumulative whole-log billed tokens ranking top spenders), and contextUsage/contextAnalysis (context gauge, remaining budget, system/tools/messages breakdown, billing buckets, cache-hit share). The context gauge mirrors the composer's ContextMeter: numerator is provider-anchored projectedTokens falling back to pressureTokens, denominator is the newest route contextWindow.",
