      "id": "claim_b62422e75ea34155b5d98cf4350950e6",
      "statement": "BackgroundSwitcher lists GAME_BACKGROUNDS and a dim slider, persisting choices to localStorage and reapplying them on startup in apply(). applyBackground writes --pg-bg-image on body and persists the key; applyDim clamps to [0,1], then writes --pg-bg-dim (black-overlay strength 0..0.7) and a derived glass-layer alpha into --dsw-specific-sidebar-fill and the --dsw-alias-bg-base/layer-1..3 tokens so wallpaper translucency and text legibility stay coupled. The wallpapers are inlined base64 data:image/webp URIs rather than served assets, and the --pg-bg-* variables are the seam the Papergames theme references.",
